2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Antti was a Ratsutilallinen (owner of a large farm that was given a tax break, because Antti took care of a cavalryman to ensure the fighting men were ready in case of war).  This farm was on the Torkki Farm in the village of Eura
2 CONC koski in the Kuikaisten Parish.
