1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birgitta was registered in class III in the coeducational school Ekenäs Samskola. She was student 1942 from same school. She participated in evacuation of war children 1942 to Sweden and Denmark. She served as assi
2 CONC stant nurse 1944 at the military hospital in Äänislinna. She was educated at the nurses' training school in Åbo 2 Aug 1945 - 1 Sep 1948. She was appointed to trained nurse in Åbo 1 Sep 1948. She served as occupational health nurse
2 CONC  at the cotton mill in Björneborg in 1970th. She served as occupational health nurse at the insurance company Industriförsäkringen in Helsingfors.
